a-packager/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/deployments","created_at":"2014-04-21T17:34:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T10:31:01Z","pushed_at":"2025-11-22T01:55:32Z","git_url":"git://github.com/shaka-project/shaka-packager.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:shaka-project/shaka-packager.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/shaka-project/shaka-packager.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/shaka-project/shaka-packager","homepage":"https://shaka-project.github.io/shaka-packager/","size":578869,"stargazers_count":2365,"watchers_count":2365,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":545,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":169,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":545,"open_issues":169,"watchers":2365,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"> ad_cues <start_time[;start_time]>\r\n>  List of cuepoint markers separated by semicolon. The start_time represents the start of the cue marker in seconds (double precision) relative to the start of the program. This flag preconditions content for Dynamic Ad Insertion with Google Ad Manager. For DASH, multiple periods will be generated with period boundaries at the next key frame to the designated start times; For HLS, segments will be terminated at the next key frame to the designated start times and ‘#EXT-X-PLACEMENT-OPPORTUNITY’ tag will be inserted after the segment in media playlist.\r\n\r\n\r\nI have some questions about this description.\r\n>  This flag preconditions content for Dynamic Ad Insertion with Google Ad Manager. \r\n1.  Whether this ad options only works with  Google Ad Manager or not.  \r\n     Before packager the HLS stream， I have request the pre-ad, mid-ad and post-ad \r\n     from our own ad server.   I found `ad_cues <start_time[;start_time]> ` only support \r\n     adding parameter `start_time`, Can't set the ad url.  If not support setting ad url, please \r\n    give some advice how to implement this feature.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> For HLS, segments will be terminated at the next key frame to the designated start times and ‘#EXT-X-PLACEMENT-OPPORTUNITY’ tag will be inserted after the segment in media playlist.\r\n2.  I have searched the HLS draft. [https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-pantos-http-live-streaming-23#section-4.3.4.1](url) .  I'm sorry, nothing has found about the `#EXT-X-PLACEMENT-OPPORTUNITY` tag.  \r\nAlso, I searched the `ExoPlayer`, the player also do nothing about this Tag.  Please hope give some useful information.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues/650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues/650/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/533147024","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6444#issuecomment-533147024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6444","id":533147024,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMzE0NzAyNA==","user":{"login":"Romantic-LiXuefeng","id":9837705,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4Mzc3MDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9837705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng","html_url":"https://github.com/Romantic-LiXuefeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Romantic-LiXuefeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-19T14:06:41Z","updated_at":"2019-09-19T14:06:41Z","body":"#https://github.com/google/shaka-packager/issues/650","author_ass